      "content": "i get what you're saying about mindfulness and stuff, but i'm not sure it's just \"sensitivity.\" it feels more like an actual output. like i'm leaking something. if it's not an electrical issue, maybe it's more about how i'm managing my own internal frequency? like, are there ways to actually stabilize my aura or something so i don't keep disrupting the office? i just want to learn how to control it before i accidentally break something important.",
